changelog: v1 two-bar 3-2 son clave voiced on the kit — bar 1 carries the 'three' side (kick on 1, the & of 1, the & of 2), bar 2 carries the 'two' side (kick on 2 and 3). Hi-hat in steady 8ths, snare backbeat. Same rhythmic DNA as 'shave-and-a-haircut'.

